# LMRS with the three lane-change strategies changed from upstream; on top of the defaults (final-v2), which already
# set the first two, so that against the default this preset changes the gap acceptance only:
#   synchronization  ALIGN_GAP_MOVING  (upstream: PASSIVE)  follow the target-lane leader or align with the middle of the
#                                      gap, whichever allows the larger acceleration; disabled below the creep speed
#   cooperation      PASSIVE_MOVING    (upstream: PASSIVE)  cooperate with a leader whose desire is at least dCoop;
#                                      disabled below the creep speed
#   gap acceptance   EGO_HEADWAY       (upstream: INFORMED) apply the own headway value instead of the other driver's
#
# Everything else, and every driver parameter, stays as the defaults set it (final-v2; see LmrsDefaults).
# Select with --preset=moving-ego-headway (MIROVA_PRESET=moving-ego-headway on the cluster).
lmrs.synchronization=ALIGN_GAP_MOVING
lmrs.cooperation=PASSIVE_MOVING
lmrs.gapAcceptance=EGO_HEADWAY
